### 环境切换（默认使用 dev）
GET {{product_url}}/api/products

### ========================================
### 商品服务测试
### ========================================

### 创建商品1
POST {{product_url}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot 实战",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 79.0,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 创建商品2
POST {{product_url}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java 核心技术",
  "author": "Cay Horstmann",
  "price": 89.0,
  "stock": 8,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 查询所有商品
GET {{product_url}}/api/products

### 查询商品详情
GET http://localhost:8081/api/products/1

### 修改商品
PUT {{product_url}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot 实战（第2版）",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "price": 89.0,
  "stock": 20,
  "category": "编程"
}

### 删除商品
DELETE {{product_url}}/api/products/1



### ========================================
### 用户服务测试
### ========================================

### 创建用户
POST {{user_url}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138000"
}

### 查询所有用户
GET {{user_url}}/api/users

### 查询用户详情
GET {{user_url}}/api/users/1

### 修改用户
PUT {{user_url}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice_new@example.com",
  "phone": "13900139000"
}

### 删除用户
DELETE {{user_url}}/api/users/1



### ========================================
### 订单服务测试
### ========================================

### 创建订单（包含两个订单项）
POST {{order_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 5
    }
  ]
}


### 查询订单详情
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/1

### 查询所有订单
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders

### 根据用户查询订单
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/user/1

### 根据状态查询订单
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/status/CREATED

### 取消订单
PUT {{order_url}}/api/orders/1/cancel

### ========================================
### 异常场景测试
### ========================================

### 创建订单 - 订单项为空（应返回 400）
POST {{order_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "items": []
}

### 创建订单 - 数量为 0（应返回 400）
POST {{order_url}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "title": "Spring Boot 实战",
      "author": "Craig Walls",
      "price": 79.0,
      "quantity": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 取消已取消的订单
PUT {{order_url}}/api/orders/1/cancel

### 查询不存在的订单
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/999



### 按照ID查询
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/products/query/1
X-Gray-Tag: v2

### 通过订单服务调用图书服务查询图书（Feign）：按照条件组成查询
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/products/query?keyword=Spring&category=编程

### 通过Feign扣减库存
POST {{order_url}}/api/orders/stock/deduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 999
}

### 通过订单服务调用图书服务查询图书（Feign）：带Token
GET {{order_url}}/api/orders/products/1/auth
Authorization: Bearer test


### 获取所有已注册的服务
GET {{order_url}}/api/discovery/services

### 获取图书服务的实例列表
GET {{order_url}}/api/discovery/book-instances

### 通过服务发现获取图书服务的详细图书信息
GET {{order_url}}/api/discovery/book/1

### 通过服务发现获取图书服务的详细图书信息（不存在）
GET {{order_url}}/api/discovery/book/999

### MQ测试
GET http://localhost:8083/api/mq/send/1002